# Service Bridge – Technology Stack

### Frontend
- React.js – User interface
- Vite – Frontend development and build tool
- Bootstrap & CSS – Responsive UI design

### Backend
- Node.js – Server-side runtime
- Express.js – Backend framework
- REST API – Frontend and backend communication

### Database
- MongoDB Atlas – Cloud database
- Mongoose – MongoDB object modeling

### Authentication & Security
- Firebase Authentication – Mobile number OTP verification
- bcrypt – Password hashing
- JSON Web Token (JWT) – Application authentication and session management
- Firebase Admin SDK – Backend verification of Firebase ID tokens

### Email Services
- Nodemailer – Sending email OTPs
- Gmail SMTP – Email delivery

### Development & Testing
- Git & GitHub – Version control and collaboration
- VS Code – Code editor
- Postman – API testing
- npm – Package management

### Deployment
- Vercel – Frontend hosting
- Render – Backend hosting

### Architecture
- MERN Stack
- RESTful API architecture
- Role-Based Access Control (RBAC)

### User Roles
- Customer
- Service Professional
- Employer
- Admin